Package: msbrowser
Title: Interactive LC-MS Data Exploration and Feature Analysis
Description: Provides a Shiny interface for interactive inspection of raw LC-MS
    data, with a focus on understanding signal and noise structure and on
    parameter tuning for xcms-based feature detection. Enables detailed
    exploration of chromatographic and spectral data beyond standard
    chromatogram views, including total and extracted ion chromatograms, and
    supports evaluation of how parameter settings influence peak picking
    performance. Resulting feature tables and visualisations facilitate method
    development, optimisation, and quality assessment of mass spectrometry
    experiments.
Version: 0.99.2
